= March 2024 — The German order book contracts

German manufacturers cut orders from Silesian factories, logistics firms and
component suppliers. This happened outside the Polish party-card economy:
growth is already **0.3 points lower**, unemployment is **0.2 points higher**
and external pressure has risen.

The shock unlocks a one-shot foreign-response card. Drawing or playing that
card will choose the Left's answer; it will not cause the contraction again.

- @berlin_order_record

@berlin_order_record
title: Put the industrial response on the leadership table
subtitle: The economic shock is already in force; a response card is now available.
go-to: poland_event_queue

