= June 2024 — A transnational right becomes material

Radical-right election gains and coalition breakthroughs abroad deliver
networks, donors, speakers and a language of inevitability to their Polish
counterparts. The external effect is immediate: the far-right agenda and
foreign pressure have already risen.

The shock unlocks one response card. The card determines what the Left does
about this new infrastructure; playing it will not create the breakthrough a
second time.

- @european_right_record

