@us_election_2020
title: America chooses an administration
subtitle: The result changes Poland's room between Washington and Europe
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2020 and month = 11 and us_election_2020_done = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.us_election_2020_done = 1;
Q.us_2020_roll = this.random.uint32() / 4294967296;
Q.us_2020_democratic_vote = Math.round(
    (51.5 + (Q.us_2020_roll - 0.5) * 8) * 10
) / 10;
Q.us_2020_republican_vote = Math.round(
    (100 - Q.us_2020_democratic_vote) * 10
) / 10;
Q.us_2020_popular_margin = Math.round(
    (Q.us_2020_democratic_vote - Q.us_2020_republican_vote) * 10
) / 10;
Q.us_2020_battleground_roll =
    this.random.uint32() / 4294967296;
Q.us_2020_democratic_tipping_margin = Math.round(
    (
        Q.us_2020_popular_margin -
        2.1 +
        (Q.us_2020_battleground_roll - 0.5) * 4
    ) * 10
) / 10;
const democraticWin = Q.us_2020_democratic_tipping_margin >= 0;
let democraticElectors = Math.round(
    269.5 + Q.us_2020_democratic_tipping_margin * 16
);
democraticElectors = Math.max(120, Math.min(418, democraticElectors));
if (democraticWin) democraticElectors = Math.max(270, democraticElectors);
else democraticElectors = Math.min(269, democraticElectors);
Q.us_2020_democratic_electors = democraticElectors;
Q.us_2020_republican_electors = 538 - democraticElectors;
Q.us_2020_popular_electoral_split =
    democraticWin != (Q.us_2020_popular_margin >= 0) ? 1 : 0;
Q.us_election_2020_winner =
    democraticWin ? "Joe Biden" : "Donald Trump";
Q.us_2020_electoral_signal =
    democraticWin
        ? (
            Q.us_2020_democratic_electors + "–" +
            Q.us_2020_republican_electors + " Democratic"
        )
        : (
            Q.us_2020_republican_electors + "–" +
            Q.us_2020_democratic_electors + " Republican"
        );
Q.us_president = Q.us_election_2020_winner;
Q.us_administration =
    democraticWin ? "Democratic" : "America First";
if (democraticWin) {
    Q.us_alliance_reliability += 10;
    Q.us_rule_of_law_pressure += 8;
    Q.eu_institutional_trust += 3;
    Q.ko_relation += 2;
    Q.pis_relation -= 2;
    Q.far_right_agenda -= 1;
    Q.news_headline =
        "Biden's victory reconnects Washington, Brussels and Polish rule-of-law politics";
} else {
    Q.us_alliance_reliability -= 4;
    Q.us_rule_of_law_pressure -= 4;
    Q.us_ambassador_channel += 4;
    Q.us_defence_channel += 4;
    Q.pis_relation += 3;
    Q.far_right_agenda += 3;
    Q.eu_influence -= 2;
    if (Q.president_name == "Andrzej Duda") {
        Q.president_relation += 4;
    }
    Q.news_headline =
        "Trump's re-election strengthens PiS's bilateral American strategy";
}
!}

= November 2020 — The American election

**[+ us_election_2020_winner +] wins.** The simulated national result is
**[+ us_2020_democratic_vote +]% Democratic** to **[+
us_2020_republican_vote +]% Republican**. The Electoral College signal is
**[+ us_2020_electoral_signal +]**, based on a separate battleground
tipping-point margin of **[+ us_2020_democratic_tipping_margin +] points for
the Democratic ticket**. [? if us_2020_popular_electoral_split = 1: The
popular-vote and Electoral College winners differ.?]

This is foreign news with immediate Polish factions. The Palace and PiS value
bilateral access; KO sees Washington and Brussels as one democratic axis; the
Left must reconcile European autonomy, institutional standards, NATO and its
own suspicion of presidential diplomacy.

[? if us_administration = "Democratic": A Biden administration raises the
credibility of NATO's institutional channels and increases American pressure
over courts and democratic standards. It also gives KO an ally and removes
PiS's claim to a uniquely privileged White House relationship.?]
[? if us_administration != "Democratic": A second Trump administration keeps
the Duda–PiS bilateral channel open while making the reliability of wider
alliance commitments harder to separate from personal access and defence
spending.?]

- @biden_front
- @biden_social
- @trump_institutions
- @trump_bilateral
- @european_insurance

